      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">باذّهُ</span></b>  <i>He hastened with him; made haste,</i> or
<i>strove, to be,</i> or <i>get, before him:</i> (K, * TA:) <i>he
vied with him in glory</i> or <i>excellence.</i> (TA.)

